          "source_name": "AoTriggeredObjective0",
          "properties": {
            "ShortName": "1. Unlock the Archive gate",
            "Description": "The archive entrance will have been sealed during the swarm attack.  To override this lockdown, locate the security control room, north of your insertion point.",
            "DebriefText": "The data appears intact; I hope it's worth the price we paid.  This campaign is over and your time on Sigma 612 has been served.  I have commended all members of the unit to Central Command, in recognition of your outstanding service.",
            "DebriefText2": "Fleet and Infantry will be here within the week to cleanse and reclaim this rock.  As for you, Bloodhound is leaving for the Actaeon in 1 hour; be on it.",
